==English==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|ML.|accitō||summon}}, from {{der|en|la-cla|acciō||call forth}}, formed from {{m|la|ad}} + {{m|la|cieō||summon, call}}. The sense “excite, induce” is likely from or reinforced by conflation with {{m|en|excite}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|accite|v}}</ref>

